Error [jet.TypestateWrongState]: `bounce_ready` needs `Vec3.Unit`, but `v` is `Vec3.Raw`
  --> tests/ui/typestate_wrong_state_free_function.jet:19:26
    |
 19 |     print("{bounce_ready(v)}")
    |                          ^
 Why: Typestate: `bounce_ready` takes only `Vec3.Unit`; calling it with `Vec3` in another state is the out-of-order bug the state list rules out
 Fix: Bring `v` to `Vec3.Unit` before calling `bounce_ready`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0150
